1
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:30,000
What would you wish for?

2
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:54,000
Three Thousand Years of Longing is a drama, fantasy,
romance film directed by George Miller.

3
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:18,000
A solitary scholar discovers an ancient bottle while on a trip to
Istanbul and unleashes a djinn who offers her three wishes.

4
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Filled with reluctance, she is unable to come up with one, so
the djinn tries to inspire her with his stories.

5
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Alithea, played by Tilda Swinton.

6
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:30,000
The Djinn, played by Idris Elba.

7
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:54,000
Professor Günhan, played by Erdil Yaşaroğlu.

8
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:18,000
British Council Lady / The Watcher, played by Sabrina Elba.

9
00:48:36,000 --> 00:48:42,000
Airport Djinn, played by Sarah Houbolt.

10
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Pale Djinn, played by Seyithan Özdemir.

11
00:59:24,000 --> 00:59:30,000
Three Thousand Years of Longing is a 2022 romantic fantasy
drama film directed and produced by George Miller.

12
01:04:48,000 --> 01:04:54,000
Written by Miller and Augusta Gore, it is based on the 1994  short
story "The Djinn in the Nightingale's Eye" by A.

13
01:10:12,000 --> 01:10:18,000
Byatt and follows a djinn (Idris Elba) who is unleashed from a bottle by a professor (Tilda
Swinton) and tells her stories from his thousands of years of existence.

14
01:15:36,000 --> 01:15:42,000
The film is dedicated to Miller's mother Angela, as well as Rena
Mitchell, relative of producer Doug Mitchell.

15
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
The film premiered out of competition at the 75th
Cannes Film Festival on May 20, 2022.

16
01:26:24,000 --> 01:26:30,000
It was released theatrically in the United States on August 26, 2022, by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Pictures (via
United Artists Releasing), and in Australia on September 1, 2022, by Roadshow Entertainment.

17
01:31:48,000 --> 01:31:54,000
It received generally positive reviews from critics, who praised its visuals and performances,
but was a box-office bomb, grossing $20.3 million against a budget of $60 million.

18
01:37:12,000 --> 01:37:18,000
The film explores themes of mythology, longing, djinn, desire, storytelling.

19
01:42:36,000 --> 01:42:42,000
The tone is emotional.
